        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hospital Push / Pull Latch, Don-Jo 4500</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon-Jo Hospital Push / Pull Latches for installations where both versatility and durability are critical. Ideal for use on hospital and industrial doors, including fire doors, when hands free door opening is required. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 2-3/4\" or 5\" backset. The short throw angle allows an easy push or pull action to open the door even when hands are not free.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Don-Jo 4500 can be mounted in any of four different positions:\r\n<li>Both handles down</li>\r\n<li>Both handles up</li>\r\n<li>Both handles point away from latch</li>\r\n<li>Both handles point toward latch</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the DJO 4500 Series Push/Pull Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>US32D Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a>.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n<li>Variable mounting positions</li>\r\n<li>Function: Passage</li>\r\n<li>Projection off Door: 3-1/4\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Body Width: 2.465\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Body Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Push/Pull Handle Height: 4.9\"</li>\r\n<li> Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6500.pdf?v=1774584064\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 6500 Hospital Latch Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
